WEBVTT

00:03:58.693 --> 00:04:01.404
or animal spirits, as he called them --

00:04:01.404 --> 00:04:04.407
can play a powerful role in markets.

00:04:04.949 --> 00:04:08.119
He also had a pretty sweet mustache.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.287
(Laughter)

00:04:10.705 --> 00:04:11.872
Anyway, I digress.

00:04:11.872 --> 00:04:16.377
The point is that I've seen the power
of what expectations can do.

00:04:16.419 --> 00:04:18.379
And here's a firsthand example.

00:04:18.379 --> 00:04:20.423
I'm from Venezuela,

00:04:20.423 --> 00:04:22.174
and in the late twenty-teens,

00:04:22.216 --> 00:04:25.803
my home country experienced
one of the worst periods of hyperinflation

00:04:25.803 --> 00:04:27.430
ever recorded.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:31.183
Now, there were many reasons
why this hyperinflation took place